    "assets": "Altera3.1Bis inside8.798Bequity investments; no extra Mobileye/IMSstake value is added to consolidated cash flows. Capital tax receivables are collected in cash, not also added as an asset. Escrow shares and cash are paired; escrow derivative is not deducted again.",
    "NCI": "Future minority cash reserve is charged once before owner cash, without a second NCIbook-equity deduction. The reserve is a normalized allocation, not a contract-level valuation; starting cash ownership and distributions are not fully traced.",
    "leases": "All-in lease/supplier cash allowance is charged once and lease liabilities are excluded from ordinary debt. This is a cash-method proxy, not a fully reconstructed lease amortization/tax schedule.",
    "debt": "Carrying debt/par run-off is used; disclosed issued-debt fair value43.4Bversus50.134Bcarrying would increase currentequity byabout1.22USD/share if substituted without other changes, not rescue the short. No claim these bases are interchangeable.",
